Bring base changes into a workspace

Usage: forkspace pull [OPTIONS] [NAME]

Arguments:
  [NAME]  Workspace name (defaults to $FORKSPACE_WORKSPACE)

Options:
      --dry-run     Show the pull plan without applying it
      --theirs      Resolve conflicts by taking the base version
      --resume      Resume an interrupted pull
      --no-install  Skip automatic dependency installation
      --json        Output the pull plan as JSON
  -h, --help        Print help
